#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid ""
"Elevate your next gathering in our state-of-the-art meeting room. Designed "
"with productivity and natural light in mind, this space offers a seamless "
"blend of modern architecture and functional design."
msgstr ""
"Rendi speciale il tuo prossimo incontro nella nostra sala riunioni "
"all’avanguardia. Progettato pensando alla produttività e alla luce naturale, "
"questo spazio offre una fusione perfetta tra architettura moderna e design "
"funzionale."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Eliminate waiting room congestion by allowing citizens to book fixed time slots for specialized services or meetings\n"
